  "_permissions_deny_comment": "decisions#303 R2: framework permission denies that scripts/sync-hooks.sh MERGES into an instance's .claude/settings.json permissions.deny (append missing, keep instance entries; skipped in the framework repo). Second layer behind the Track 2f hook floor for the audit spool family, its backups, the drain helper and the security policy file; and behind the Track 2e connector gate for the two claude.ai M365 connector SharePoint search tools (decisions#306).",
